@startuml state-donation
!include _style.iuml
title State machine — Donation (txn_status with failure_reason)

[*] --> PENDING : create(campaign, amount)\n/ create gateway order

PENDING --> CONFIRMED : paymentVerified(amount)\n[signature valid and amount matches]\n/ issue receipt
PENDING --> FAILED : cancel\n/ failure_reason := ABANDONED
PENDING --> FAILED : paymentFailed\n/ failure_reason := GATEWAY_DECLINED
PENDING --> FAILED : after(30 min)\n/ failure_reason := EXPIRED
FAILED --> CONFIRMED : paymentVerified(amount)\n[late capture, amount matches]\n/ issue receipt

CONFIRMED --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED
  A repeated webhook (same event id) is ignored.
  A capture for a different payment on a CONFIRMED
  donation is flagged PAYMENT_CONFLICT, not applied.
end note
note bottom of FAILED
  FAILED is not final: a verified late capture
  still confirms it, so captured money is never lost.
end note
@enduml
